    "detailed_description": "This is a simple and challenging indie level game that tests your patience. <br />\r\nThe controls in this game are very simple and intuitive. <br />\r\nTo keep you focused, the background music of this game is very simple. <br />\r\nBy using the ticking of the clock to make your attention more focused, you can successfully complete the level in less time.<br />\r\nYou can easily see the time spent in the game. <br />\r\nYou can keep challenging yourself to get better results.<br />\r\nYou can also compete with your friends to beat the level faster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you're bored and tired of playing some complex games, try this simple  simple simple mini-game.<br />\r\nIn a word It's fun, it's not complicated.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHow to play:<br />\r\nMove metal ring from start to finish<br />\r\nDon\u2018t touch anything<br />\r\nPay attention to the time it takes<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout control commands\uff1a<br />\r\nThere are instructions in the lower left corner of the game scene.",
